are slightly different.

00:01:03.595 --> 00:01:06.966
Are you regularly tested for
sexually transmitted diseases?

00:01:07.433 --> 00:01:08.868
Excuse me?
(CHUCKLES NERVOUSLY)

00:01:08.968 --> 00:01:10.502
He and I still sleep together,

00:01:10.903 --> 00:01:14.707
so I would be more relaxed
to know that you are clean.

00:01:15.141 --> 00:01:18.177
And I think she shocks people
and puts them on their heels,

00:01:18.277 --> 00:01:20.513
<i> so it was interesting
 seeing her do that to Rhea.</i>

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:23.582
(STAMMERS)
This isn't appropriate talk--

00:01:23.682 --> 00:01:24.651
When I lose...

00:01:25.251 --> 00:01:28.688
the other one will generally
lose an eye or so.

00:01:30.656 --> 00:01:32.859
CROWD: Surprise!

00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:35.728
