the Logan-athon.

00:01:35.828 --> 00:01:36.996
<i> She thinks it will be nice.</i>

00:01:37.096 --> 00:01:38.331
LOGAN ROY: Jesus H. Christ.

00:01:38.798 --> 00:01:40.933
ARMSTRONG:<i> I don't know whether
 she's quite judged, exactly,</i>

00:01:41.033 --> 00:01:42.635
<i> things that Logan prizes
 in life,</i>

00:01:42.735 --> 00:01:45.138
